Package: uxmaster-sshguard
Version: 2.4.3-1
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Jacek Stypuła <sshguard@drStypula.pl>
Depends: iptables, lsb-base (>= 3.0-6), libc6 (>= 2.14)
Provides: sshguard
Conflicts: sshguard
Replaces: sshguard
Section: net
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://gitlab.com/uxmaster/sshguard
Description: Protects from brute force attacks against ssh and other services
 Protects networked hosts from the today's widespread
 brute force attacks against ssh servers. It detects such attacks
 and blocks the author's address with a firewall rule.
Original-Maintainer: Julián Moreno Patiño <julian@debian.org>
